[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4393400995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119300#issuecomment-4393400995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119300","id":4393400995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBd36ow","user":{"login":"wagnerfs","id":106078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjA3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs","html_url":"https://github.com/wagnerfs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T01:25:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T01:25:39Z","body":"Just to add up, but I think I may have pinpointed the issue starting at https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bc192293b13a8891cb8739a36d8c0736a5c4c4b8/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp#L2881\n\nDoes seem like it only tosses  the main buffer and that's it. I might test around adding `glGenerateMipmap(GL_TEXTURE_2D);` to see if it'd change anything.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4393400995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4401464881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119300#issuecomment-4401464881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119300","id":4401464881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBlkGMQ","user":{"login":"wagnerfs","id":106078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjA3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs","html_url":"https://github.com/wagnerfs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T21:52:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T21:52:53Z","body":"I actually got it working by making `check_backbuffer` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bc192293b13a8891cb8739a36d8c0736a5c4c4b8/drivers/gles3/storage/render_scene_buffers_gles3.cpp#L463 allocate spaces for mipmap and then updating https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bc192293b13a8891cb8739a36d8c0736a5c4c4b8/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp#L2881 by calling:\n```\nint mipmaps = Image::get_image_required_mipmaps(size.x, size.y, Image::\nGLES3::CopyEffects::get_singleton()->gaussian_blur(backbuffer, mipmaps, Rect2i(0, 0, size.x, size.y), size);\n```\nTo fill in the data (had to add extra gl calls to restore state because depth buffer was getting messed up after gaussian_blur was caled).\n\nAnyway, I'll open a PR when I get the time.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4401464881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5249337638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119300#issuecomment-5249337638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119300","id":5249337638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOOKJJg","user":{"login":"Kajinor","id":7585932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODU5MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7585932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor","html_url":"https://github.com/Kajinor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kajinor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T05:28:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T05:28:48Z","body":"I have the same issue and I remember its an issue since years. This is not the only report about it iirc. Would be cool if this could be fixed, especially since Mobile/Forward+ are more or less unusable on mid-range phones. Just reading from screen texture there brings FPS down to 20 in an empty scene but stays 120 FPS with Compatibility. So having the ability to read from depth and screen texture with Lod in a Spatial shader opens up new possibilities with Compatibility renderer.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5249337638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]